      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '

        In this module, we are going to do hand hygiene training
        through a typical task you would do in your daily job.


        First, we
        will walk you through the interactions that will happen in the scene and
        the gestures you can apply.


        Then, you will use these rules and
        methods in your training session.


        Finally, review the results when
        the training finished.'
